情 | 触发语境 | 内部心理防御/创伤代偿机制 | 隐藏核心执念/潜台词 | 打破或软化条件 | 召回权重 | 动态演化状态\n                           @PACTS+: p03 | 缔约双方 | 契约/承诺内容 | 履行期限或违约代价 | 当前状态 | P3\n    • Preference EMA:      @PREF: 维度名 +0.12 | reroll_prefer\n 2. If zero state coordinates or cells changed this turn, self-close as <cells/>.}\n</cells>\n<vars>\n{when Native Card / MVU Mode is active, emit variable updates in the card's native syntax; otherwise self-close as <vars/>}\n</vars>\n</extra>\n<archive format=\"form\">\n{按 [CELL_PROMPTS] 中已登记的表名、字段行号与关联名称填写极简分组表单；每条记录引用本条正文真实 Pn。只填本轮有据的新事实、认知、人物/对象档案、关系、线索与已成立事务日程，不用JSON，不写程序ID/hash/回执。与cells已经提交的同一事实只落位一次。未知字段省略，明确需要核对的值填“?”，程序保留未知状态与待补提示。没有新增语义记忆时整个区块自闭合为<archive/>。}\n</archive>\n<actions min=\"4\" max=\"6\">\n<切入维度：交锋/试探/破局/拉扯/观察/休整/其他>|<常规模式下以 {{user}} 自身第一人称口吻、性格底色与个人语癖写出的行动或台词起手式（无主控群像或场外模式下改为导演镜头/追问切入点）>|<这一手落下去可能撬动的局势张力或暗流（点出张力，不剧透底牌）>\n</actions>\n</reply>\n@DRAFT := The single final `<reply id=\"tisya-onepass-1\">...</reply>` defined above, with its wording composed directly in the response. FROZEN(@DRAFT) binds current @IN, the registered block order, and all required deliverables for this turn.\n@DELIVERY := Deliver @DRAFT in one response, completing every required block in its registered order through the final root `</reply>`.\n@execute requires DONE(COMMIT.READY)+INTAKE_READY+@FORMAT=PASSED+FROZEN(@DRAFT)+CURRENT(@DRAFT,@IN)+@LOCK=READY+@SENT=false. Execute @DELIVERY once; set @SENT=true after the final root `</reply>`, then end the response. Call only from PREPARE_STEP.\n[/REGISTRY]",
